## How to Use This File

1. Looking for something? Search this file first.
2. Creating a new document? Add it to the appropriate category below.
3. Referencing a document elsewhere? Use the path from this registry.
4. Starting a new session? Read `[PROJECT]_Key_Context_File_Index.md` instead. This file is for targeted lookups.
5. Finding a file: use the category whose "When to read" directive matches your current work.

