### Plain Language Summary

This file is the complete table of contents for every file in the project. Files are organized into categories, each labeled with a "when to read" directive so AI assistants and humans can find the right source for the right work. When you can't find a file, search here first. When you create a new file, add it to the appropriate category. When you reference a document from elsewhere, use the path from this registry.

The slim session-startup subset lives in `[PROJECT]_Key_Context_File_Index.md` — that file is what gets read at every session start; this file is what gets read when you need the full project inventory.
